  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "Historical UML class diagram of the SPDX community's draft 3.0 core model (circa September 2020). SpdxElement (SPDXID, Name) is the root; Identity, specialised by Person (Email), Organization (Email) and Tool (Version), specialises it. Artifact (Summary, Description) has 0..1 Originator and 0..1 Supplier Identity, Checksums (Hash: Algorithm, Value) and ExternalReferences (Category, Type, Locator, Comment). Package (Version) contains Files by PackageFile, File (Type) has Snippets (ByteRange, LineRange) by FromFile, and all three specialise Artifact. Annotation (Date, Type, Comment) has an Annotator Identity and an SPDXREF to an element; Relationship (Type, Comment) has To and From elements; SpdxDocument (SPDXVersion, DataLicence, a base-namespace URI — printed 'Banesoace', as drawn — Created, Profiles) has a Creator Identity and ExternalDocumentReferences (DocumentRef, Locator) with a Checksum.",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01VfkKocGaQW7Msro2t5S66U"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-10-03",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "Diagramme de classes UML historique du modèle Core provisoire 3.0 de la communauté SPDX (vers septembre 2020). SpdxElement (SPDXID, Name) en est la racine ; Identity, spécialisée par Person (Email), Organization (Email) et Tool (Version), la spécialise. Artifact (Summary, Description) a 0..1 Originator et 0..1 Supplier de type Identity, des Checksums (Hash : Algorithm, Value) et des ExternalReferences (Category, Type, Locator, Comment). Package (Version) contient des Files par PackageFile, File (Type) a des Snippets (ByteRange, LineRange) par FromFile, et tous trois spécialisent Artifact. Annotation (Date, Type, Comment) a un Annotator de type Identity et un SPDXREF vers un élément ; Relationship (Type, Comment) a des éléments To et From ; SpdxDocument (SPDXVersion, DataLicence, une URI d'espace de noms de base — imprimée « Banesoace », tel quel dans le dessin —, Created, Profiles) a un Creator de type Identity et des ExternalDocumentReferences (DocumentRef, Locator) avec un Checksum.",
      "state": "draft",
